{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"overview","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Overview"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function queryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>(options: QueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey> & object): ReturnType<DefinedInitialDataOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>> & QueryKeyWithDataTag<TQueryKey, TQueryFnData, TError>;\nfunction queryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>(options: QueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey> & object): ReturnType<UndefinedInitialDataOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>> & QueryKeyWithDataTag<TQueryKey, TQueryFnData, TError>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"#call-signature-1","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ReturnType<DefinedInitialDataOptions>"},{"type":"text","value":" → "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ReturnType<DefinedInitialDataOptions> & QueryKeyWithDataTag"}]},{"type":"text","value":": You can generally pass everything to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" that you can also pass to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useQuery"},{"type":"text","value":". These options can be shared across hooks and imperative APIs such as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryClient.query"},{"type":"text","value":". "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options.queryKey"},{"type":"text","value":" is required and is the query key to generate options for."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"#call-signature-2","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ReturnType<UndefinedInitialDataOptions>"},{"type":"text","value":" → "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ReturnType<UndefinedInitialDataOptions> & QueryKeyWithDataTag"}]},{"type":"text","value":": You can generally pass everything to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" that you can also pass to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useQuery"},{"type":"text","value":". These options can be shared across hooks and imperative APIs such as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryClient.query"},{"type":"text","value":". "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options.queryKey"},{"type":"text","value":" is required and is the query key to generate options for."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See also: "},{"type":"link","href":"#parameters-summary","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"text","value":" · "},{"type":"link","href":"#returns-summary","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]}]},{"type":"html","value":"<a id=\"call-signature-1\"></a>"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"call-signature","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Call Signature"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function queryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>(options: QueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey> & object): ReturnType<DefinedInitialDataOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>> & QueryKeyWithDataTag<TQueryKey, TQueryFnData, TError>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/solid-query/src/queryOptions.ts#L86","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/solid-query/src/queryOptions.ts:86"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"You can generally pass everything to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" that you can also pass to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useQuery"},{"type":"text","value":". These options can\nbe shared across hooks and imperative APIs such as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryClient.query"},{"type":"text","value":". "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options.queryKey"},{"type":"text","value":" is required and\nis the query key to generate options for."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This overload is selected when "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"initialData"},{"type":"text","value":" is set, so the resulting "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"data"},{"type":"text","value":" is never "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":" (unless\na "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select"},{"type":"text","value":" changes "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" to include "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":")."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"tqueryfndata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TQueryFnData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"terror","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TError"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Error"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"tquerykey","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TQueryKey"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryKey"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" readonly "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":"[] = readonly "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":"[]"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/QueryOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryKey"},{"type":"text","value":"> & "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"object"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/DefinedInitialDataOptions.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"DefinedInitialDataOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":" to use — everything you can pass to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useQuery"},{"type":"text","value":", with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"initialData"},{"type":"text","value":" set."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ReturnType"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/DefinedInitialDataOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DefinedInitialDataOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryKey"},{"type":"text","value":">> & "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/QueryKeyWithDataTag.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryKeyWithDataTag"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryKey"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The same options object, typed so that "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryKey"},{"type":"text","value":" carries the inferred data type."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"see","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"useQuery.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"useQuery"}]},{"type":"text","value":" to run a query with these options."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { For } from 'solid-js'\nimport { queryOptions, useQuery } from '@tanstack/solid-query'\n\nconst postsOptions = queryOptions({\n  queryKey: ['posts'],\n  queryFn: fetchPosts,\n  initialData: [],\n})\n\nfunction Posts() {\n  // `postsQuery.data` is `Post[]`, never `undefined`, thanks to `initialData` — even if a refetch fails,\n  // so the list stays visible alongside the error.\n  const postsQuery = useQuery(() => postsOptions)\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      {postsQuery.isError ? <span>Error: {postsQuery.error.message}</span> : null}\n      <ul>\n        <For each={postsQuery.data}>{(post) => <li>{post.title}</li>}</For>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"html","value":"<a id=\"call-signature-2\"></a>"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"call-signature-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Call Signature"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function queryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>(options: QueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey> & object): ReturnType<UndefinedInitialDataOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>> & QueryKeyWithDataTag<TQueryKey, TQueryFnData, TError>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/solid-query/src/queryOptions.ts#L134","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/solid-query/src/queryOptions.ts:134"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"You can generally pass everything to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" that you can also pass to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useQuery"},{"type":"text","value":". These options can\nbe shared across hooks and imperative APIs such as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryClient.query"},{"type":"text","value":". "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options.queryKey"},{"type":"text","value":" is required and\nis the query key to generate options for."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"type-parameters-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"tqueryfndata-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TQueryFnData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"terror-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TError"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Error"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"tdata-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"tquerykey-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TQueryKey"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryKey"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" readonly "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":"[] = readonly "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":"[]"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"parameters-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"options-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/QueryOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryKey"},{"type":"text","value":"> & "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"object"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/UndefinedInitialDataOptions.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"UndefinedInitialDataOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":" to use — everything you can pass to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useQuery"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"returns-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ReturnType"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/UndefinedInitialDataOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"UndefinedInitialDataOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryKey"},{"type":"text","value":">> & "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/QueryKeyWithDataTag.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryKeyWithDataTag"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryKey"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The same options object, typed so that "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryKey"},{"type":"text","value":" carries the inferred data type."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"see-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"useQuery.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"useQuery"}]},{"type":"text","value":" to run a query with these options."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"example-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A parameterized factory, so the same options object can be reused per "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"id"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { Match, Switch } from 'solid-js'\nimport { queryOptions, useQuery } from '@tanstack/solid-query'\n\nconst postOptions = (id: string) =>\n  queryOptions({\n    queryKey: ['post', id],\n    queryFn: () => fetchPost(id),\n  })\n\nfunction Post(props: { id: string }) {\n  const postQuery = useQuery(() => postOptions(props.id))\n\n  return (\n    <Switch>\n      <Match when={postQuery.isPending}>Loading...</Match>\n      <Match when={postQuery.isError}>Error: {postQuery.error.message}</Match>\n      <Match when={postQuery.isSuccess}>\n        <h1>{postQuery.data.title}</h1>\n      </Match>\n    </Switch>\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"html","value":"<a id=\"parameters-summary\"></a>"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters-3","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options-3","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/QueryOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryKey"},{"type":"text","value":"> & "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"object"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/UndefinedInitialDataOptions.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"UndefinedInitialDataOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":" to use — everything you can pass to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useQuery"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"html","value":"<a id=\"options-properties\"></a>"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"options-properties","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options"},{"type":"text","value":" properties"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Built from "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/QueryOptions.md#properties","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":". See the type above for what it changes."}]},{"type":"html","value":"<a id=\"returns-summary\"></a>"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns-3","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ReturnType"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/UndefinedInitialDataOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"UndefinedInitialDataOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryKey"},{"type":"text","value":">> & "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/QueryKeyWithDataTag.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryKeyWithDataTag"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryKey"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The same options object, typed so that "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryKey"},{"type":"text","value":" carries the inferred data type."}]},{"type":"html","value":"<a id=\"result-properties\"></a>"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"result-properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Result properties"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Built from "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/QueryOptions.md#properties","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/QueryKeyWithDataTag.md#properties","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryKeyWithDataTag"}]},{"type":"text","value":". See the type above for what it changes."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"id":"call-signature","text":"Call Signature","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":3},{"id":"tqueryfndata","text":"TQueryFnData","level":4},{"id":"terror","text":"TError","level":4},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":4},{"id":"tquerykey","text":"TQueryKey","level":4},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":3},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":4},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":3},{"id":"see","text":"See","level":3},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":3},{"id":"call-signature-2","text":"Call Signature","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters-2","text":"Type Parameters","level":3},{"id":"tqueryfndata-2","text":"TQueryFnData","level":4},{"id":"terror-2","text":"TError","level":4},{"id":"tdata-2","text":"TData","level":4},{"id":"tquerykey-2","text":"TQueryKey","level":4},{"id":"parameters-2","text":"Parameters","level":3},{"id":"options-2","text":"options","level":4},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":3},{"id":"see-2","text":"See","level":3},{"id":"example-2","text":"Example","level":3},{"id":"parameters-3","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"options-3","text":"options","level":3},{"id":"options-properties","text":"options properties","level":4},{"id":"returns-3","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"result-properties","text":"Result properties","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n## Overview\n\n```ts\nfunction queryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>(options: QueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey> & object): ReturnType<DefinedInitialDataOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>> & QueryKeyWithDataTag<TQueryKey, TQueryFnData, TError>;\nfunction queryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>(options: QueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey> & object): ReturnType<UndefinedInitialDataOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>> & QueryKeyWithDataTag<TQueryKey, TQueryFnData, TError>;\n```\n\n- [`ReturnType<DefinedInitialDataOptions>` → `ReturnType<DefinedInitialDataOptions> & QueryKeyWithDataTag`](#call-signature-1): You can generally pass everything to `queryOptions` that you can also pass to `useQuery`. These options can be shared across hooks and imperative APIs such as `queryClient.query`. `options.queryKey` is required and is the query key to generate options for.\n- [`ReturnType<UndefinedInitialDataOptions>` → `ReturnType<UndefinedInitialDataOptions> & QueryKeyWithDataTag`](#call-signature-2): You can generally pass everything to `queryOptions` that you can also pass to `useQuery`. These options can be shared across hooks and imperative APIs such as `queryClient.query`. `options.queryKey` is required and is the query key to generate options for.\n\nSee also: [Parameters](#parameters-summary) · [Returns](#returns-summary)\n\n<a id=\"call-signature-1\"></a>\n\n## Call Signature\n\n```ts\nfunction queryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>(options: QueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey> & object): ReturnType<DefinedInitialDataOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>> & QueryKeyWithDataTag<TQueryKey, TQueryFnData, TError>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/solid-query/src/queryOptions.ts:86](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/solid-query/src/queryOptions.ts#L86)\n\nYou can generally pass everything to `queryOptions` that you can also pass to `useQuery`. These options can\nbe shared across hooks and imperative APIs such as `queryClient.query`. `options.queryKey` is required and\nis the query key to generate options for.\n\nThis overload is selected when `initialData` is set, so the resulting `data` is never `undefined` (unless\na `select` changes `TData` to include `undefined`).\n\n### Type Parameters\n\n#### TQueryFnData\n\n`TQueryFnData` = `unknown`\n\n#### TError\n\n`TError` = `Error`\n\n#### TData\n\n`TData` = `TQueryFnData`\n\n#### TQueryKey\n\n`TQueryKey` *extends* readonly `unknown`[] = readonly `unknown`[]\n\n### Parameters\n\n#### options\n\n[`QueryOptions`](../interfaces/QueryOptions.md)\\<`TQueryFnData`, `TError`, `TData`, `TQueryKey`\\> & `object`\n\nThe [DefinedInitialDataOptions](../type-aliases/DefinedInitialDataOptions.md) to use — everything you can pass to `useQuery`, with `initialData` set.\n\n### Returns\n\n`ReturnType`\\<[`DefinedInitialDataOptions`](../type-aliases/DefinedInitialDataOptions.md)\\<`TQueryFnData`, `TError`, `TData`, `TQueryKey`\\>\\> & [`QueryKeyWithDataTag`](../type-aliases/QueryKeyWithDataTag.md)\\<`TQueryKey`, `TQueryFnData`, `TError`\\>\n\nThe same options object, typed so that `queryKey` carries the inferred data type.\n\n### See\n\n[useQuery](useQuery.md) to run a query with these options.\n\n### Example\n\n```tsx\nimport { For } from 'solid-js'\nimport { queryOptions, useQuery } from '@tanstack/solid-query'\n\nconst postsOptions = queryOptions({\n  queryKey: ['posts'],\n  queryFn: fetchPosts,\n  initialData: [],\n})\n\nfunction Posts() {\n  // `postsQuery.data` is `Post[]`, never `undefined`, thanks to `initialData` — even if a refetch fails,\n  // so the list stays visible alongside the error.\n  const postsQuery = useQuery(() => postsOptions)\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      {postsQuery.isError ? <span>Error: {postsQuery.error.message}</span> : null}\n      <ul>\n        <For each={postsQuery.data}>{(post) => <li>{post.title}</li>}</For>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n<a id=\"call-signature-2\"></a>\n\n## Call Signature\n\n```ts\nfunction queryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>(options: QueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey> & object): ReturnType<UndefinedInitialDataOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>> & QueryKeyWithDataTag<TQueryKey, TQueryFnData, TError>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/solid-query/src/queryOptions.ts:134](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/solid-query/src/queryOptions.ts#L134)\n\nYou can generally pass everything to `queryOptions` that you can also pass to `useQuery`. These options can\nbe shared across hooks and imperative APIs such as `queryClient.query`. `options.queryKey` is required and\nis the query key to generate options for.\n\n### Type Parameters\n\n#### TQueryFnData\n\n`TQueryFnData` = `unknown`\n\n#### TError\n\n`TError` = `Error`\n\n#### TData\n\n`TData` = `TQueryFnData`\n\n#### TQueryKey\n\n`TQueryKey` *extends* readonly `unknown`[] = readonly `unknown`[]\n\n### Parameters\n\n#### options\n\n[`QueryOptions`](../interfaces/QueryOptions.md)\\<`TQueryFnData`, `TError`, `TData`, `TQueryKey`\\> & `object`\n\nThe [UndefinedInitialDataOptions](../type-aliases/UndefinedInitialDataOptions.md) to use — everything you can pass to `useQuery`.\n\n### Returns\n\n`ReturnType`\\<[`UndefinedInitialDataOptions`](../type-aliases/UndefinedInitialDataOptions.md)\\<`TQueryFnData`, `TError`, `TData`, `TQueryKey`\\>\\> & [`QueryKeyWithDataTag`](../type-aliases/QueryKeyWithDataTag.md)\\<`TQueryKey`, `TQueryFnData`, `TError`\\>\n\nThe same options object, typed so that `queryKey` carries the inferred data type.\n\n### See\n\n[useQuery](useQuery.md) to run a query with these options.\n\n### Example\n\nA parameterized factory, so the same options object can be reused per `id`:\n```tsx\nimport { Match, Switch } from 'solid-js'\nimport { queryOptions, useQuery } from '@tanstack/solid-query'\n\nconst postOptions = (id: string) =>\n  queryOptions({\n    queryKey: ['post', id],\n    queryFn: () => fetchPost(id),\n  })\n\nfunction Post(props: { id: string }) {\n  const postQuery = useQuery(() => postOptions(props.id))\n\n  return (\n    <Switch>\n      <Match when={postQuery.isPending}>Loading...</Match>\n      <Match when={postQuery.isError}>Error: {postQuery.error.message}</Match>\n      <Match when={postQuery.isSuccess}>\n        <h1>{postQuery.data.title}</h1>\n      </Match>\n    </Switch>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n<a id=\"parameters-summary\"></a>\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n[`QueryOptions`](../interfaces/QueryOptions.md)\\<`TQueryFnData`, `TError`, `TData`, `TQueryKey`\\> & `object`\n\nThe [UndefinedInitialDataOptions](../type-aliases/UndefinedInitialDataOptions.md) to use — everything you can pass to `useQuery`.\n\n<a id=\"options-properties\"></a>\n\n#### `options` properties\n\nBuilt from [`QueryOptions`](../interfaces/QueryOptions.md#properties). See the type above for what it changes.\n\n<a id=\"returns-summary\"></a>\n\n## Returns\n\n`ReturnType`\\<[`UndefinedInitialDataOptions`](../type-aliases/UndefinedInitialDataOptions.md)\\<`TQueryFnData`, `TError`, `TData`, `TQueryKey`\\>\\> & [`QueryKeyWithDataTag`](../type-aliases/QueryKeyWithDataTag.md)\\<`TQueryKey`, `TQueryFnData`, `TError`\\>\n\nThe same options object, typed so that `queryKey` carries the inferred data type.\n\n<a id=\"result-properties\"></a>\n\n### Result properties\n\nBuilt from [`QueryOptions`](../interfaces/QueryOptions.md#properties), [`QueryKeyWithDataTag`](../type-aliases/QueryKeyWithDataTag.md#properties). See the type above for what it changes.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: queryOptions\ntitle: queryOptions\nredirect_from:\n  - framework/solid/reference/queryOptions\n---\n\n## Overview\n\n```ts\nfunction queryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>(options: QueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey> & object): ReturnType<DefinedInitialDataOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>> & QueryKeyWithDataTag<TQueryKey, TQueryFnData, TError>;\nfunction queryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>(options: QueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey> & object): ReturnType<UndefinedInitialDataOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>> & QueryKeyWithDataTag<TQueryKey, TQueryFnData, TError>;\n```\n\n- [`ReturnType<DefinedInitialDataOptions>` → `ReturnType<DefinedInitialDataOptions> & QueryKeyWithDataTag`](#call-signature-1): You can generally pass everything to `queryOptions` that you can also pass to `useQuery`. These options can be shared across hooks and imperative APIs such as `queryClient.query`. `options.queryKey` is required and is the query key to generate options for.\n- [`ReturnType<UndefinedInitialDataOptions>` → `ReturnType<UndefinedInitialDataOptions> & QueryKeyWithDataTag`](#call-signature-2): You can generally pass everything to `queryOptions` that you can also pass to `useQuery`. These options can be shared across hooks and imperative APIs such as `queryClient.query`. `options.queryKey` is required and is the query key to generate options for.\n\nSee also: [Parameters](#parameters-summary) · [Returns](#returns-summary)\n\n<a id=\"call-signature-1\"></a>\n\n## Call Signature\n\n```ts\nfunction queryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>(options: QueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey> & object): ReturnType<DefinedInitialDataOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>> & QueryKeyWithDataTag<TQueryKey, TQueryFnData, TError>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/solid-query/src/queryOptions.ts:86](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/solid-query/src/queryOptions.ts#L86)\n\nYou can generally pass everything to `queryOptions` that you can also pass to `useQuery`. These options can\nbe shared across hooks and imperative APIs such as `queryClient.query`. `options.queryKey` is required and\nis the query key to generate options for.\n\nThis overload is selected when `initialData` is set, so the resulting `data` is never `undefined` (unless\na `select` changes `TData` to include `undefined`).\n\n### Type Parameters\n\n#### TQueryFnData\n\n`TQueryFnData` = `unknown`\n\n#### TError\n\n`TError` = `Error`\n\n#### TData\n\n`TData` = `TQueryFnData`\n\n#### TQueryKey\n\n`TQueryKey` *extends* readonly `unknown`[] = readonly `unknown`[]\n\n### Parameters\n\n#### options\n\n[`QueryOptions`](../interfaces/QueryOptions.md)\\<`TQueryFnData`, `TError`, `TData`, `TQueryKey`\\> & `object`\n\nThe [DefinedInitialDataOptions](../type-aliases/DefinedInitialDataOptions.md) to use — everything you can pass to `useQuery`, with `initialData` set.\n\n### Returns\n\n`ReturnType`\\<[`DefinedInitialDataOptions`](../type-aliases/DefinedInitialDataOptions.md)\\<`TQueryFnData`, `TError`, `TData`, `TQueryKey`\\>\\> & [`QueryKeyWithDataTag`](../type-aliases/QueryKeyWithDataTag.md)\\<`TQueryKey`, `TQueryFnData`, `TError`\\>\n\nThe same options object, typed so that `queryKey` carries the inferred data type.\n\n### See\n\n[useQuery](useQuery.md) to run a query with these options.\n\n### Example\n\n```tsx\nimport { For } from 'solid-js'\nimport { queryOptions, useQuery } from '@tanstack/solid-query'\n\nconst postsOptions = queryOptions({\n  queryKey: ['posts'],\n  queryFn: fetchPosts,\n  initialData: [],\n})\n\nfunction Posts() {\n  // `postsQuery.data` is `Post[]`, never `undefined`, thanks to `initialData` — even if a refetch fails,\n  // so the list stays visible alongside the error.\n  const postsQuery = useQuery(() => postsOptions)\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      {postsQuery.isError ? <span>Error: {postsQuery.error.message}</span> : null}\n      <ul>\n        <For each={postsQuery.data}>{(post) => <li>{post.title}</li>}</For>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n<a id=\"call-signature-2\"></a>\n\n## Call Signature\n\n```ts\nfunction queryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>(options: QueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey> & object): ReturnType<UndefinedInitialDataOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>> & QueryKeyWithDataTag<TQueryKey, TQueryFnData, TError>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/solid-query/src/queryOptions.ts:134](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/solid-query/src/queryOptions.ts#L134)\n\nYou can generally pass everything to `queryOptions` that you can also pass to `useQuery`. These options can\nbe shared across hooks and imperative APIs such as `queryClient.query`. `options.queryKey` is required and\nis the query key to generate options for.\n\n### Type Parameters\n\n#### TQueryFnData\n\n`TQueryFnData` = `unknown`\n\n#### TError\n\n`TError` = `Error`\n\n#### TData\n\n`TData` = `TQueryFnData`\n\n#### TQueryKey\n\n`TQueryKey` *extends* readonly `unknown`[] = readonly `unknown`[]\n\n### Parameters\n\n#### options\n\n[`QueryOptions`](../interfaces/QueryOptions.md)\\<`TQueryFnData`, `TError`, `TData`, `TQueryKey`\\> & `object`\n\nThe [UndefinedInitialDataOptions](../type-aliases/UndefinedInitialDataOptions.md) to use — everything you can pass to `useQuery`.\n\n### Returns\n\n`ReturnType`\\<[`UndefinedInitialDataOptions`](../type-aliases/UndefinedInitialDataOptions.md)\\<`TQueryFnData`, `TError`, `TData`, `TQueryKey`\\>\\> & [`QueryKeyWithDataTag`](../type-aliases/QueryKeyWithDataTag.md)\\<`TQueryKey`, `TQueryFnData`, `TError`\\>\n\nThe same options object, typed so that `queryKey` carries the inferred data type.\n\n### See\n\n[useQuery](useQuery.md) to run a query with these options.\n\n### Example\n\nA parameterized factory, so the same options object can be reused per `id`:\n```tsx\nimport { Match, Switch } from 'solid-js'\nimport { queryOptions, useQuery } from '@tanstack/solid-query'\n\nconst postOptions = (id: string) =>\n  queryOptions({\n    queryKey: ['post', id],\n    queryFn: () => fetchPost(id),\n  })\n\nfunction Post(props: { id: string }) {\n  const postQuery = useQuery(() => postOptions(props.id))\n\n  return (\n    <Switch>\n      <Match when={postQuery.isPending}>Loading...</Match>\n      <Match when={postQuery.isError}>Error: {postQuery.error.message}</Match>\n      <Match when={postQuery.isSuccess}>\n        <h1>{postQuery.data.title}</h1>\n      </Match>\n    </Switch>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n<a id=\"parameters-summary\"></a>\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n[`QueryOptions`](../interfaces/QueryOptions.md)\\<`TQueryFnData`, `TError`, `TData`, `TQueryKey`\\> & `object`\n\nThe [UndefinedInitialDataOptions](../type-aliases/UndefinedInitialDataOptions.md) to use — everything you can pass to `useQuery`.\n\n<a id=\"options-properties\"></a>\n\n#### `options` properties\n\nBuilt from [`QueryOptions`](../interfaces/QueryOptions.md#properties). See the type above for what it changes.\n\n<a id=\"returns-summary\"></a>\n\n## Returns\n\n`ReturnType`\\<[`UndefinedInitialDataOptions`](../type-aliases/UndefinedInitialDataOptions.md)\\<`TQueryFnData`, `TError`, `TData`, `TQueryKey`\\>\\> & [`QueryKeyWithDataTag`](../type-aliases/QueryKeyWithDataTag.md)\\<`TQueryKey`, `TQueryFnData`, `TError`\\>\n\nThe same options object, typed so that `queryKey` carries the inferred data type.\n\n<a id=\"result-properties\"></a>\n\n### Result properties\n\nBuilt from [`QueryOptions`](../interfaces/QueryOptions.md#properties), [`QueryKeyWithDataTag`](../type-aliases/QueryKeyWithDataTag.md#properties). See the type above for what it changes.\n"}
